<Page x:Class="Flux.Native.Views.Pages.About.About"
      xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
      xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
      xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006" 
      xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008" 
      xmlns:iconPacks="http://metro.mahapps.com/winfx/xaml/iconpacks"
      xmlns:local="clr-namespace:Flux.Native.Views.Pages"
      mc:Ignorable="d" 
      d:DesignHeight="550" d:DesignWidth="780"
      Title="About">

    <Grid Background="Transparent" Margin="24,20,24,24">
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="*" />
            <RowDefinition Height="auto" />
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="0" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" 
                     CanContentScroll="False" PanningMode="VerticalOnly">
            <Border Style="{StaticResource StandardCardStyle}" Background="#C0353535">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource BodyTextStyle}" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                        
                        <!-- Main Introduction -->
                        <Run FontSize="24" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#4FC3F7">🤖 Welcome to Flux!</Run>
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <Italic>Your friendly neighborhood automation companion!</Italic> 🏠
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <!-- Humorous Description -->
                        <Bold>What does this magical software do?</Bold> 🎩✨
                        <LineBreak/>
                        Think of Flux as your personal digital assistant that never sleeps, never complains, and definitely doesn't ask for coffee breaks! ☕
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        This automation suite is like having a super-powered robot that can:
                        <LineBreak/>
                        • 🕸️ <Bold>Web Scraping</Bold> - Turn websites into your personal data goldmine
                        <LineBreak/>
                        • 🔍 <Bold>Data Parsing</Bold> - Make sense of messy data like a digital detective
                        <LineBreak/>
                        • 🛡️ <Bold>Security Testing</Bold> - Find vulnerabilities before the bad guys do
                        <LineBreak/>
                        • 🔧 <Bold>API Testing</Bold> - Poke and prod APIs until they confess their secrets
                        <LineBreak/>
                        • 📊 <Bold>Data Analysis</Bold> - Turn numbers into insights (and insights into profits!)
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <!-- Fun Features -->
                        <Run FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#81C784">Why You'll Love It:</Run> 💚
                        <LineBreak/>
                        ✅ <Bold>Blazing Fast</Bold> - Powered by .NET 8 (faster than your morning espresso!)
                        <LineBreak/>
                        ✅ <Bold>User Friendly</Bold> - So intuitive, even your pet could use it (results may vary)
                        <LineBreak/>
                        ✅ <Bold>Highly Configurable</Bold> - More options than a fancy coffee shop
                        <LineBreak/>
                        ✅ <Bold>Open Source</Bold> - Free as in freedom (and free as in beer!)
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <!-- Important Notice -->
                        <Run FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#F44336" FontSize="16">⚠️ SUPER IMPORTANT LEGAL STUFF! ⚠️</Run>
                        <LineBreak/>
                        <Span Foreground="{DynamicResource ForegroundBad}">
                            Use your powers wisely, young padawan! 🧙‍♂️ Only test on websites you own or have explicit permission to test. 
                            Breaking into someone else's digital castle without permission is not just rude - it's <Bold>illegal</Bold>! 
                            We're here to build, not break! 🏗️💪
                        </Span>
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <!-- Credits -->
                        <Run FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#FFC107">🎉 The Awesome Humans Behind This Magic:</Run>
                        <LineBreak/>
                        🎨 <Bold>Created by</Bold>: <Span Foreground="LightPink">Ruri</Span> (The mastermind!)
                        <LineBreak/>
                        🤝 <Bold>Amazing Contributors</Bold>: A fantastic community of developers who make this software better every day!
                        <LineBreak/>
                        🧪 <Bold>Beta Testers</Bold>: The brave souls who clicked buttons before anyone else knew what they did
                        <LineBreak/>
                        💝 <Bold>Supporters</Bold>: The generous people who keep the coffee flowing and servers running
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <!-- Final Message -->
                        <Run FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#9C27B0">🚀 Ready to Automate Your World?</Run>
                        <LineBreak/>
                        Whether you're a seasoned pro or just starting your automation journey, Flux is here to make your digital life easier, 
                        faster, and a whole lot more fun! Remember: with great power comes great responsibility (and hopefully great results)! 
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <Span Foreground="{DynamicResource ForegroundGood}">
                            <Bold>💡 Pro Tip:</Bold> This software is <Italic>Open Source</Italic> and licensed under the MIT license. 
                            Feel free to peek under the hood, contribute improvements, or just star us on GitHub! ⭐
                        </Span>
                        <LineBreak/><LineBreak/>
                        
                        <Run FontStyle="Italic" Foreground="#607D8B">Happy Automating! 🎊</Run>
                    </TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
        </ScrollViewer>

        <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource CompactCardStyle}" Background="#80404040" Margin="0,16,0,0">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
                <Button x:Name="licenseButton" Style="{StaticResource StyledButton}" Click="OpenLicense" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <iconPacks:PackIconMaterial Kind="FileDocumentOutline" Margin="0,0,4,0"/>
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center">License</TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <Button x:Name="donateButton" Style="{StaticResource StyledButton}" Click="OpenDonation" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <iconPacks:PackIconMaterial Kind="Bitcoin" Margin="0,0,4,0"/>
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center">Donate</TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <Button x:Name="repoButton" Style="{StaticResource StyledButton}" Click="OpenRepository" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <iconPacks:PackIconMaterial Kind="Git" Margin="0,0,4,0"/>
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center">Repository</TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <Button x:Name="forumButton" Style="{StaticResource StyledButton}" Click="OpenForum" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <iconPacks:PackIconForkAwesome Kind="Users" Margin="0,0,4,0"/>
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center">Official Forum</TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <Button x:Name="issuesButton" Style="{StaticResource StyledButton}" Click="OpenIssues">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <iconPacks:PackIconForkAwesome Kind="Bug" Margin="0,0,4,0"/>
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center">Report an issue</TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
            </StackPanel>
        </Border>
    </Grid>
</Page>

